==================================================

- Use resource-aware concurrency.
- Prevent queue duplication.
- Use idempotent stage/job keys.
- Persist progress between stages.
- Recover safely after process restart.
- Handle network loss.
- Handle source/API timeouts.
- Handle missing chunks.
- Handle render failure.
- Handle duplicate output IDs.
- Handle OAuth expiry/disconnection.
- Handle upload verification failure.
- Handle analytics unavailable.
- Use bounded retries and backoff.
- Do not delete final output or user data.
- Do not delete active dependencies.
- Temporary asset cleanup only after verified dependency checks and safe
